keywords:
  - phonetics
  - voice quality
  - acoustic analysis
  - Praat
  - PraatSauce
  - fundamental frequency
  - formants
  - H1-H2
  - harmonics-to-noise ratio
  - 语音学
  - 声学分析
  - 发声态
  - 方言调查

